{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34271","headline":"鹤媒歌 · 陆龟蒙","name":"鹤媒歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偶系渔舟汀树枝，因看射鸟令人悲。\n盘空野鹤忽然下，背翳见媒心不疑。\n媒闲静立如无事，清唳时时入遥吹。\n裴回未忍过南塘，且应同声就同类。\n梳翎宛若相逢喜，祗怕才来又惊起。\n窥鳞啄藻乍低昂，立定当胸流一矢。\n媒欢舞跃势离披，似谄功能邀弩儿。\n云飞水宿各自物，妬侣害羣犹尔爲。\n而况世间有名利，外头笑语中猜忌。\n君不见荒陂野鹤陷良媒，同类同声真可畏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}